"Lot-ReviewInfo"},{"lot":"LOT-0003","mention_name":"Raad Van State","organization_id":225,"organization_name":"Raad van State","role":"Lot-ReviewOrg"},{"lot":"LOT-0004","mention_name":"Haven van Antwerpen-Brugge, NV van publiek recht","organization_id":11910,"organization_name":"Haven van Antwerpen-Brugge, NV van publiek recht","role":"Contract-Signatory"},{"lot":"LOT-0004","mention_name":"Procurement","organization_id":11911,"organization_name":"Procurement","role":"Lot-AddInfo"},{"lot":"LOT-0004","mention_name":"Raad Van State","organization_id":225,"organization_name":"Raad van State","role":"Lot-ReviewInfo"},{"lot":"LOT-0004","mention_name":"Raad Van State","organization_id":225,"organization_name":"Raad van State","role":"Lot-ReviewOrg"},{"lot":"LOT-0005","mention_name":"Haven van Antwerpen-Brugge, NV van publiek recht","organization_id":11910,"organization_name":"Haven van Antwerpen-Brugge, NV van publiek recht","role":"Contract-Signatory"},{"lot":"LOT-0005","mention_name":"Procurement","organization_id":11911,"organization_name":"Procurement","role":"Lot-AddInfo"},{"lot":"LOT-0005","mention_name":"Raad Van State","organization_id":225,"organization_name":"Raad van State","role":"Lot-ReviewInfo"},{"lot":"LOT-0005","mention_name":"Raad Van State","organization_id":225,"organization_name":"Raad van State","role":"Lot-ReviewOrg"},{"lot":"LOT-0005","mention_name":"THV Collectief Schapenbegrazing Havengebied (CSH)","organization_id":23118465,"organization_name":"THV Collectief Schapenbegrazing Havengebied (CSH)","role":"Tenderer"}],"procedure_key":"9c5a7320-e4b4-4492-a415-c37d49b761bc","procedure_type":"neg-w-call","publication_id":"00319890-2025","published_at":"2025-05-19","source":"ted","submission_deadline":null,"submission_deadline_scope":null,"texts":[{"field":"description","lang":"NLD","lot":null,"value":"Het doel van de opdracht is het beheer van ecologische gebieden in havengebied door rasterbegrazing met schapen en geiten en bijkomend maaien ten behoeve van:\n-\tInstandhouding en ontwikkeling van schrale vegetatie;\n-\tVergrassing tegengaan;\n-\tVerruiging tegen gaan;\n-\tOpslag van struiken en bomen remmen.\n\nGezien de verspreiding van de gebieden worden deze in clusters samengebracht. De opdracht wordt aanbesteed in 5 percelen volgens deze clusters.\n\n•\tPerceel 1: Bufferdijk Putten West – Drijdijck – Putten Weiden – Wisselweide LPW1\n•\tPerceel 2: Haasop – R2 vlakte – Wisselweide LPW2\n•\tPerceel 3: Steenlandpolder – Beverentunnel – Wisselweide A\n•\tPerceel 4: Talud spoorweg Lillobrug – Grote Kreek – Zwartkopmeeuwenbroedplaats - Wisselweide Tijsmanstunnel zuid – Fort Filips\n•\tPerceel 5: De Zouten – Stacatradijk – Wisselweide Tijsmanstunnel Noord"},{"field":"title","lang":"NLD","lot":null,"value":"Raamovereenkomst voor de begrazing in functie van ecologisch beheer in Havengebied Antwerpen"},{"field":"description","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0001","value":"Bufferdijk Putten West – Drijdijck – Putten Weiden – Wisselweide LPW1"},{"field":"title","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0001","value":"Bufferdijk Putten West – Drijdijck – Putten Weiden – Wisselweide LPW1"},{"field":"description","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0002","value":"Haasop – R2 vlakte – Wisselweide LPW2"},{"field":"title","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0002","value":"Haasop – R2 vlakte – Wisselweide LPW2"},{"field":"description","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0003","value":"Steenlandpolder – Beverentunnel – Wisselweide A"},{"field":"title","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0003","value":"Steenlandpolder – Beverentunnel – Wisselweide A"},{"field":"description","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0004","value":"Talud spoorweg Lillobrug – Grote Kreek – Zwartkopmeeuwenbroedplaats - Wisselweide Tijsmanstunnel zuid – Fort Filips"},{"field":"title","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0004","value":"Talud spoorweg Lillobrug – Grote Kreek – Zwartkopmeeuwenbroedplaats - Wisselweide Tijsmanstunnel zuid – Fort Filips"},{"field":"description","lang":"NLD","lot":"LOT-0005","value":"De Zouten – Stacatradijk – Wisselweide Tijsman